paragraphs:
“He comes up out of the water bringing up the world with Him, and sees the heavens opened which Adam had shut against himself and his posterity.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/310240.htm
)

“He did not go to be cleansed Himself, but to bury the old man in the water.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/200112.htm
)

“The waters were made holy by the flesh of the Lord, that having received His sanctification, they might afterwards be able to give it.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/0321.htm
)
